    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9688" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">compressus</span></b> ,
		ūs, m.
		comprimo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a pressing together, compression</i> (only in <i>abl. sing.</i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: semen tepefactum vapore et compressu suo
			diffindit (terra), * <i><span class="en">Cic. Sen.
				15, 51</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pennarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 28, 34, § 98</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Esp., <i>an embracing, copulation</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut.
				Am. prol. 109</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Ep. 4, 1, 15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Truc.
				2, 6, 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ter. Ad. 3, 4, 29</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Macr. S. 5, 19</span></i>.</div>
